This repository also holds third-party material used only by its tests. None of it is part of the published
@typesol/cli package.

- test/programs/: program binaries dumped from Solana clusters. The ones kept in the repository are Apache-2.0:
  SPL Account Compression and SPL Noop (solana-labs/solana-program-library), Program Metadata
  (solana-program/program-metadata), coral-xyz/multisig, Raydium CP-Swap and Raydium CLMM (raydium-io), Jito's tip
  payment, tip distribution and priority fee distribution programs (jito-foundation/jito-programs), and marginfi v2
  (mrgnlabs/marginfi-v2). The licence text is test/programs/LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt; each binary's source, program id
  and sha256 are in test/programs/SOURCES.md.
  The Metaplex programs, under the Metaplex(TM) NFT Open Source License 1.0, are not kept here: scripts/fetch-programs.sh
  downloads them.
- test/fixtures/marginfi/: Marginfi v2's on-chain IDL and three of its mainnet accounts (mrgnlabs/marginfi-v2,
  Apache-2.0), and I80F48 vectors written with the fixed crate (MIT or Apache-2.0).
- test/fixtures/clmm/: Raydium CLMM's on-chain IDL and the accounts of one mainnet pool (raydium-io/raydium-clmm,
  Apache-2.0).

Examples under examples/ that port these programs (raydium-cp-swap, raydium-clmm, jito-mev, marginfi, multisig.ts)
follow their originals' source, which is Apache-2.0; see each file's header.
